        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>上傳成績單</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Microsoft JhengHei',Arial,sans-serif;background:#f1f5f9;color:#0f172a;padding:20px}.card{background:#fff;max-width:560px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.08)}h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px}.muted{color:#64748b}label{display:block;margin-top:16px;font-weight:600}input,textarea,button{width:100%;font-size:17px;padding:12px;margin-top:6px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:12px;font-family:inherit}button{background:#4f46e5;color:#fff;border:0;margin-top:22px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.big{font-size:56px;text-align:center;margin:8px 0}</style></head><body><main class=\"card\"><div class=\"big\">📊</div><h1>成績單分析</h1>\n<p class=\"muted\">上傳 CSV 成績單，n8n 會自動算出各科平均、及格率、前五名與需要補救的同學。</p>\n<form method=\"post\" action=\"/webhook/grade-report\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\">\n<label>選擇 CSV 檔案<input type=\"file\" name=\"file\" accept=\".csv\" required></label>\n<button type=\"submit\">開始分析</button></form>\n<p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">CSV 第一列是欄位名稱，例如：姓名,學號,國文,英文,數學（請存成 UTF-8 編碼）</p></main></body></html>",
